    "method": "billing.billingSpendSummaryGet",
    "toolName": "billing-spend-summary-get",
    "operationId": "billing_spend_summary_retrieve",
    "title": "Get spend this billing period",
    "category": "Billing",
    "description": "Amounts accrued so far this billing period, before and after discount, per product, add-on and tier, with the two totals. An organization total, so it needs full billing access: owners always, and admins when owner-only billing is off. Use it for \"what have we spent so far this month\". For the projection to the end of the period call billing-forecast-get, and for spend over time call billing-spend-timeseries-get. Beta: behind the organization-billing-api flag, and the output shape may change while it is.",
